   "text": "the screen is an ASSOCIATION screen, not causal.\nSCOPED (same population, inside policy) is right not\nto flag when the segment churns anyway; but a rule-level\nscreen misses harm routed through other rules",
   "originalText": "the screen is an ASSOCIATION screen, not causal.\nSCOPED (same population, inside policy) is right not\nto flag when the segment churns anyway; but a rule-level\nscreen misses harm routed through other rules",
